<problem>
<!-- <title>differentiate cubic</title> -->

<setup>

<selectFromSequence name="a" from="1" to=" 7" />
<selectFromSequence name="b" numToSelect="2" withReplacement="true" from="-5" to=" 5" />
<selectFromSequence name="d" from="1" to=" 10" />

<math name="answer" simplify="full">3*$a*x^2 + 2*$b[1]*x + $b[2] </math>
<math name="fun" simplify="full">$a *x^3 + $b[1] *x^2 + $b[2] *x + $d </math>

</setup>


Compute the derivative, <m>\frac{ df }{ dx }</m>, of the function <m>f(x)</m> below

<me>f(x) = $fun .</me>

<m>f'(x) =</m> 
<answer>
<award symbolicEquality="true" simplifyOnCompare="numbers">$answer </award>
</answer>

<solution>
<m>f'(x)=$answer </m>

</solution>


</problem>